  _udonSharpBackingUdonBehaviour: {fileID: 3418783662401632171}
  myText: {fileID: 0}
  languageIndex: 0
  pageNumber: 4
  texts:
  - "3e. <indent=5%>Accordingly, the <b>x</b> and <b>y</b> components of the allowed
    impulses that the X-ray can exchange with the lattice are: \r\n<align=center><size=115%><b><i>M<sub>x</sub>
    = \u03C4h/a</b></i>\r\n</size></align>and \r\n<align=center><size=115%><b><i>M<sub>y</sub>
    = \u03C4'h/b</b></i></size>\r\n</align>where <b>\u03C4</b> and <b>\u03C4'</b>
    are integer constants. \r\nConsequently, the change in angle between the incident
    and outgoing rays must satisfy:\r\n<align=center><size=115%><b><i>hf/c(cos(\u03B8)-cos(\u03B8'))
    = \u03C4h/a</i></b>\r\n </size></align>and \r\n<align=center><b><size=115%><i>hf/c(sin(\u03B8)-sin(\u03B8'))
    = \u03C4'h/b</i></b>\r\n</size></align>"
  - "<size=110%>3e. \u3057\u305F\u304C\u3063\u3066\u3001X\u7DDA\u304C\u683C\u5B50\u3068\u4EA4\u63DB\u3057\u5F97\u308B\u8A31\u5BB9\u904B\u52D5\u91CF\u306E<b>x</b>\u6210\u5206\u304A\u3088\u3073<b>y</b>\u6210\u5206\u306F\u3001\u4EE5\u4E0B\u306E\u901A\u308A\u3067\u3042\u308B\u3002\r\n<align=center><size=115%><b><i>M<sub>x</sub>
    = \u03C4h/a</i></b></size>\r\n</align>\u304A\u3088\u3073\r\n<align=center><size=115%><b><i>M<sub>y</sub>
    = \u03C4'h/b</i></b></size>\r\n</align>\u3053\u3053\u3067\u3001<b>\u03C4</b>\u304A\u3088\u3073<b>\u03C4'</b>\u306F\u6574\u6570\u5B9A\u6570\u3067\u3042\u308B\u3002\r\n\u305D\u306E\u7D50\u679C\u3001\u5165\u5C04\u5149\u7DDA\u3068\u51FA\u5C04\u5149\u7DDA\u306E\u9593\u306E\u89D2\u5EA6\u306E\u5909\u5316\u306F\u3001\u4EE5\u4E0B\u306E\u95A2\u4FC2\u3092\u6E80\u305F\u3055\u306A\u3051\u308C\u3070\u306A\u3089\u306A\u3044\u3002\r\n<align=center><size=115%><b><i>hf/c(cos(\u03B8)-cos(\u03B8'))
    = \u03C4h/a</i></b>\r\n</size></align>\u304A\u3088\u3073\r\n<align=center><size=115%><b><i>hf/c(sin(\u03B8)-sin(\u03B8'))
    = \u03C4'h/b</i></b>\r\n</size></align>"
  - "3e. \u56E0\u6B64\uFF0CX\u5C04\u7DDA\u53EF\u8207\u6676\u683C\u4EA4\u63DB\u7684\u5141\u8A31\u8108\u885D\u7684x\u548Cy\u5206\u91CF\u5206\u5225\u70BA\uFF1A\r\n<align=center><size=115%><b><i>M<sub>x</sub>
    = \u03C4h/a\r</b></i><size>\r\n</align>\r\u4EE5\u53CA\r\n<align=center><size=115%><b><i>M<sub>y</sub>
    = \u03C4'h/b\r</b></i><size>\r\n</align>\u5176\u4E2D\u03C4\u548C\u03C4'\u70BA\u6574\u6578\u5E38\u6578\u3002\u56E0\u6B64\uFF0C\u5165\u5C04\u5149\u7DDA\u548C\u51FA\u5C04\u5149\u7DDA\u4E4B\u9593\u7684\u593E\u89D2\u8B8A\u5316\u5FC5\u9808\u6EFF\u8DB3\uFF1A\r\n\r<align=center><size=115%><b><i>hf/c(cos(\u03B8)-cos(\u03B8'))
    = \u03C4h/a</i></b>\r\n</size></align>\u4E26\u4E14\r\n<align=center><b><size=115%><i>hf/c(sin(\u03B8)-sin(\u03B8'))
    = \u03C4'h/b</i></b>\r\n\r</size></align>"
  - "<size=110%>3e. \u56E0\u6B64\uFF0CX\u5C04\u7EBF\u4E0E\u6676\u683C\u4E4B\u95F4\u6240\u80FD\u4EA4\u6362\u7684\u51B2\u91CF\uFF0C\u5176
    <b>x</b> \u548C <b>y</b> \u5206\u91CF\u5206\u522B\u4E3A\uFF1A\r\n<align=center><size=115%><b><i>M<sub>x</sub>
    = \u03C4h/a</i></b></size>\r\n</align>\u4EE5\u53CA\r\n<align=center><size=115%><b><i>M<sub>y</sub>
    = \u03C4'h/b</i></b></size>\r\n</align>\u5176\u4E2D <b>\u03C4</b> \u548C <b>\u03C4'</b>
    \u4E3A\u6574\u6570\u5E38\u6570\u3002\r\n\u7531\u6B64\u53EF\u77E5\uFF0C\u5165\u5C04\u5C04\u7EBF\u4E0E\u51FA\u5C04\u5C04\u7EBF\u4E4B\u95F4\u7684\u89D2\u5EA6\u53D8\u5316\u5FC5\u987B\u6EE1\u8DB3\u4EE5\u4E0B\u5173\u7CFB\uFF1A\r\n<align=center><size=115%><b><i>hf/c(cos(\u03B8)-cos(\u03B8'))
    = \u03C4h/a</i></b>\r\n</size></align>\u4EE5\u53CA\r\n<align=center><size=115%><b><i>hf/c(sin(\u03B8)-sin(\u03B8'))
    = \u03C4'h/b</i></b>\r\n</size></align>"
  - "<size=110%>3e. \uB530\uB77C\uC11C X\uC120\uC774 \uACA9\uC790\uC640 \uAD50\uD658\uD560
    \uC218 \uC788\uB294 \uD5C8\uC6A9\uB41C \uC6B4\uB3D9\uB7C9\uC758 <b>x</b> \uC131\uBD84\uACFC
    <b>y</b> \uC131\uBD84\uC740 \uB2E4\uC74C\uACFC \uAC19\uB2E4.\r\n<align=center><size=115%><b><i>M<sub>x</sub>
    = \u03C4h/a</i></b></size>\r\n</align>\uADF8\uB9AC\uACE0\r\n<align=center><size=115%><b><i>M<sub>y</sub>
    = \u03C4'h/b</i></b></size>\r\n</align>\uC5EC\uAE30\uC11C <b>\u03C4</b>\uC640
    <b>\u03C4'</b>\uB294 \uC815\uC218 \uC0C1\uC218\uC774\uB2E4.\r\n\uACB0\uACFC\uC801\uC73C\uB85C,
    \uC785\uC0AC X\uC120\uACFC \uC0B0\uB780\uB41C X\uC120 \uC0AC\uC774\uC758 \uAC01\uB3C4
    \uBCC0\uD654\uB294 \uB2E4\uC74C \uC2DD\uC744 \uB9CC\uC871\uD574\uC57C \uD55C\uB2E4.\r\n<align=center><size=115%><b><i>hf/c(cos(\u03B8)-cos(\u03B8'))
    = \u03C4h/a</i></b>\r\n</size></align>\uADF8\uB9AC\uACE0\r\n<align=center><size=115%><b><i>hf/c(sin(\u03B8)-sin(\u03B8'))
    = \u03C4'h/b</i></b>\r\n</size></align>"
  - "3e. <indent=5%>Consequentemente, as componentes <b>x</b> e <b>y</b> dos impulsos
    permitidos que o raio X pode trocar com a rede cristalina s\xE3o:\r\n<align=center><size=115%><b><i>M<sub>x</sub>
    = \u03C4h/a</b></i></size>\r\n</align>e\r\n<align=center><size=115%><b><i>M<sub>y</sub>
    = \u03C4'h/b</b></i></size>\r\n</align>onde <b>\u03C4</b> e <b>\u03C4'</b> s\xE3o
    constantes inteiras.\r\nPor conseguinte, a varia\xE7\xE3o no \xE2ngulo entre
    os raios incidente e emergente deve satisfazer:\r\n<align=center><size=115%><b><i>hf/c(cos(\u03B8)-cos(\u03B8'))
    = \u03C4h/a</i></b>\r\n</size></align>e\r\n<align=center><b><size=115%><i>hf/c(sin(\u03B8)-sin(\u03B8'))
    = \u03C4'h/b</i></b>\r\n</size></align>"
  - "3e. <indent=5%>Par cons\xE9quent, les composantes <b>x</b> et <b>y</b> des impulsions
    autoris\xE9es que le rayon X peut \xE9changer avec le r\xE9seau cristallin sont
    :\r\n<align=center><size=115%><b><i>M<sub>x</sub> = \u03C4h/a</i></b></size>\r\n</align>et\r\n<align=center><size=115%><b><i>M<sub>y</sub>
    = \u03C4'h/b</i></b></size>\r\n</align>o\xF9 <b>\u03C4</b> et <b>\u03C4'</b>
    sont des constantes enti\xE8res.\r\nIl en r\xE9sulte que la variation d'angle
    entre les rayons incident et sortant doit satisfaire aux relations suivantes
    :\r\n<align=center><size=115%><b><i>hf/c(cos(\u03B8)-cos(\u03B8')) = \u03C4h/a</i></b>\r\n</size></align>et\r\n<align=center><b><size=115%><i>hf/c(sin(\u03B8)-sin(\u03B8'))
    = \u03C4'h/b</i></b>\r\n</size></align>"
--- !u!114 &3418783662401632171
